From: Caboose <caboose@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/17] Record command buffers locally and send them with their
 submit

In the synchronous socket profile, vkBeginCommandBuffer..vkEndCommandBuffer are
recorded into a per-command-buffer, budgeted local stream
(caboose-bounded-memory/cb_staging.h) with no network traffic. vkQueueSubmit
and vkQueueSubmit2 send every staged command buffer, secondaries first, ahead
of the submit in a single round trip. Command buffers are no longer registered
twice with their pool.
